              "name": "MattOlay V-H"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Had the same issue as the first reviewer. Was this meant to be a crunchy/toffee topping because i expected it to be somewhat a softer sauce. I boiled it on medium heat for at least 3 minutes. More than that, it would've been burnt crispy. I cooled it for a few minutes but when I was ready to use the topping, it was thick, almost hardened. I had to reheat it and added about 1/4 cup of heavy cream."
